[34.10884, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J\r\n  VALIDATION RESULT\r\n  =================\r\n\r\n   9.43.0.0/24  Valid      installed with validation-state 1\r\n  10.43.0.0/24  Invalid    held with validation-state 3, ineligible\r\n  11.43.0.0/24  NotFound   installed with validation-state 2\r\n\r\n  Only the two policy-accepted routes can be selected.\r\n  No public RPKI cache or route collector was contacted.\r\n\r\n  Recording complete.\r\n\u001b[?2004h$ "]
